---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
---

<Site
  title="Support"
  description="Get help with Kitewell, report a bug, or privately report a security issue."
>
  <section class="page wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">A little help</p>
    <h1>Find your next step.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Start with the guides. If something still isn't working, open an issue
      with the details needed to reproduce it.
    </p>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Questions & bugs</h2>
        <p>
          Include your Kitewell version, operating system, processor, and the
          steps that led to the problem. Remove credentials and private data
          from logs.
        </p>
        <a
          class="button"
          href="https://github.com/dagucloud/kitewell/issues/new/choose"
        >
          Open an issue ↗
        </a>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Security reports</h2>
        <p>
          Report vulnerabilities privately through GitHub. Include the affected
          version and a reproducible example without real credentials.
        </p>
        <a
          class="button secondary"
          href="https://github.com/dagucloud/kitewell/security/advisories/new"
        >
          Report privately ↗
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Useful starting points</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="/docs/getting-started/">Create your first workflow</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/docs/troubleshooting/">Troubleshoot a failed run</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/docs/scheduling/">
            Understand sleep and background operation
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/docs/backups/">Back up and restore your workspace</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        For team rollouts, pricing, or other business questions,
        <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
